---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — FreeTrustDocs" description="FreeTrustDocs.com does not collect or store your personal information. All document generation is client-side.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> Legal <span>›</span> Privacy</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <h2>Your Data Stays In Your Browser</h2>
      <p>
        FreeTrustDocs.com generates all documents entirely in your browser. The information you enter into the wizard
        — trust names, trustee names, addresses, tax IDs — is never sent to any server. There is no database,
        no backend, and no data collection of your personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The information you enter into the wizard</li>
        <li>The documents you generate</li>
        <li>Your name, email, or contact information</li>
        <li>Account credentials (we have no accounts)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What We Do Collect</h2>
      <p>We may use the following standard analytics tools:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4:</strong> Aggregated, anonymous traffic data (page views, session duration, country).</li>
        <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity:</strong> Anonymous heatmaps and session recordings to improve usability.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These tools do not capture the information you type into the wizard form fields.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Analytics tools may set cookies. No cookies are used for tracking your personal information or wizard inputs.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Resources</h2>
      <p>The PDF generation library (pdfmake) is loaded from a CDN. The font library is also loaded from a CDN. These CDNs may log standard request metadata.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>If we add any data collection features in the future (e.g., optional email capture), we will update this policy and clearly disclose what is collected and how it is used.</p>

      <h2>Who Operates This Site</h2>
      <p>FreeTrustDocs.com is owned and operated by <strong>Agentic Trust</strong>, which is responsible for the content and operation of this website.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>FreeTrustDocs.com is owned and operated by Agentic Trust. For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:support@agentictrust.app">support@agentictrust.app</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>